        "reasoning": "[D], [G] and [B] together resolve the whole situation. You go to the sickest patient with interim instructions already given ([D]), you escalate her early to someone more senior ([G]), and you hand the coordination of the rest of your list to the person whose job that is ([B]). Each of the other options either puts a less urgent task ahead of Mrs Hale ([A], [H], [F]) or manages her deterioration at a distance ([E]). [C] is the only one that is unprofessional in itself rather than mistimed.",
